abstract: >
  A C library for CAN bus and CAN FD on STM32 (bxCAN, FDCAN, H7), ESP32 (TWAI) and the external
  MCP2515 / MCP2517FD / MCP2518FD SPI controllers, with one umbrella header and one configuration file.
